<title>MALAYSIA: Union Paper suspended at firm's request.</title>
<headline>Union Paper suspended at firm's request.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Union Paper Bhd has been suspended from Wednesday's trading at the company's request, said an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The stock of the paper products and manufacturing company was last traded on Tuesday at 17.80 ringgit, down 50 cents.  </p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
